summary: E2E test for oci-delta with bootc images
description: |
    End-to-end testing of the oci-delta workflow on real bootc images:
    pull base and target images, create a delta, apply it to reconstruct
    the target image, and (in VM mode) switch the bootc deployment,
    reboot, and verify the new deployment.

    The binary under test defaults to the from-source build in the
    project root. Set OCI_DELTA_SOURCE=rpm to test the installed RPM
    binary instead (resolved from PATH, with the installed NVR
    asserted), or point OCI_DELTA at an explicit binary path.
test: ./e2e-bootc-test.sh
duration: 2h
